### Build artifacts
# tsdown writes /dist/ and TypeDoc writes docs/reference/api/; nothing here emits a
# top-level types/ or an src/bld/, so neither is listed. Add a path when a tool writes it.
/dist/
/.tmp/
docs/.vitepress/cache/
docs/.vitepress/dist/
docs/public/llms*.txt
docs/reference/api/
docs/doc-index.md
demos/node/output/
demos/showcases/output/

### Editors
.idea/
*.swp
*~

### Claude Code local/runtime files (shared config like .claude/settings.json stays tracked)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
# Local junction/symlink mirroring .agents/skills/ for Skill-registry discovery; canonical source lives in .agents/
.claude/skills/
